    ClassName: Bastion
  UnitName: Ignis
  UnitTitle: The Crimson Bastion
  IsRomanceable: 0
  SummonQuote: Sovereign, it is an honor to serve you.
  BriefDescription: A loyal combatant in the Maou's forces holding the rank of R.
  LoreEntries:
  - Title: THE EMBER'S AWAKENING
    Content: Born within the deep volcanic veins of the Abyssal Core, Ignis was shaped
      by liquid fire itself. Unlike other demons, her flame did not burn with malicious
      destruction, but with a vibrant, eternal radiance. She spent her early decades
      meditating inside the molten chambers, learning the art of heat flow and thermal
      containment. Her heart, however, remained cold and isolated, waiting for a
      master whose sovereignty could match her inner blaze.
  - Title: MAOU'S SHIELD
    Content: "During the Great Crusade of the Sanctus Alliance, the Demon Lord was
      ambushed by celestial archers. From the shadows, a young Ignis leaped forward,
      expanding her soul-flame into a massive incandescent barrier. She absorbed
      three hundred consecutive high-tier arrows without faltering, earning her place
      as the Maou's trusted guardian. When the battle settled and the Lord pulled
      a stray shard of celestial iron from her arm, their eyes met for the first
      time\u2014igniting a silent, deep-rooted devotion that transcended mere military
      contract."
  - Title: THE PHOENIX RITE
    Content: To achieve the status of Master, Ignis underwent the legendary Phoenix
      Rite inside the Smoldering Crag. She dissolved her own physical form into pure
      ashes, only to reconstitute her body three days later, clad in indestructible
      obsidian armor and carrying a greatsword forged from her own solid soul-fire.
      In her darkest hour of burning dissolution, it was the voice of the Demon Lord
      calling her name across the astral rift that anchored her soul, guiding her
      back to the realm of the living.
  - Title: SHIELD AND SOUL
    Content: 'Ignis''s ultimate pride lies not in her offensive capabilities, but
      in her unyielding defense. She swore a sacred oath on her Greatsword: ''As
      long as my heart carries a spark, no ally behind my shield shall feel the chill
      of defeat or the sting of arrows.'' Yet, in the quiet midnight hours outside
      the Lord''s private chambers, she confessed a deeper, unwritten vow: she would
      protect the Maou not just as a loyal vassal, but as a woman whose very soul
      beats in absolute, burning resonance with theirs.'
  - Title: ETERNAL EMBERS (ROMANCE)
    Content: 'A legendary memory documenting the nature of her immortal core. Even
      if her armor is shattered and her physical body succumbs to steel, the embers
      within her heart can never be fully extinguished. When her core is triggered
      by a high-voltage emotional bond with the Lord, she gains complete, unconditional
      rebirth. Under the crimson starlight, Ignis leaned in close, her breath warm
      as a desert wind: ''My fire exists solely to warm your throne, my Lord. Take
      my heart, keep it in your palm, and I shall never burn out.'''
